<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Cavisson CI/CD task plugin for Jenkins. Adds Cavisson execution tasks as build steps and
  Pipeline steps, starting with "Cavisson - Run Test" (triggers a Cavisson TestSuite or Load
  Test scenario and waits for completion). Connection to the Cavisson DashboardServer is
  configured directly on each task (base URL + API token), or by referencing an existing
  Cavisson Service Connection credential if the cav-security-pipeline plugin is also installed.
</div>
